# judge-do-line

EXPORT TEMPLATE judge-do-line:
  ABOUT   judge rule for every DO line — the line tells the agent to do exactly one thing
  TAGS    #judge

  SLOTS:
    action: TEXT  "the action the agent performs — one imperative verb and what it applies to"
      SHOULD write exactly one imperative verb for the agent — a list of objects is fine; subclause verbs don't count
  BODY:
    DO {action}
  EXAMPLE:
    DO run npm test before declaring done
